@startuml Auth_Flow
title User Authentication (UC1)

actor Traveler
participant "FastAPI App" as API
participant "Auth Service" as AuthSvc
participant "Firebase Auth" as Firebase

== Sign Up ==

Traveler -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/signup\n{email, password, name}
activate API

API -> Firebase: createUserWithEmail(email, password)
activate Firebase
Firebase --> API: {uid, idToken}
deactivate Firebase

API -> AuthSvc: register_user(uid, email, name)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc --> API: {user_id, profile}
deactivate AuthSvc

API --> Traveler: 201 {access_token, user}
deactivate API

== Login ==

Traveler -> API: POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{email, password}
activate API

API -> Firebase: signInWithEmail(email, password)
activate Firebase
Firebase --> API: {idToken, refreshToken}
deactivate Firebase

API -> AuthSvc: verify_and_get_user(uid)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc --> API: {user, token_pair}
deactivate AuthSvc

API --> Traveler: 200 {access_token, refresh_token, user}
deactivate API

@enduml
